## The paper-and-enamel palette of the Sparks & Machines journey (docs/concept/v0.7/02-art-direction.md and the
## U1 interface sheet): cream paper and dark ink, teal/red/cream enamel, brass fittings. Shadows lean blue-violet,
## never black. Only that journey's interface uses it; every other screen keeps Pal.

